msgctxt "76"
msgid "...You okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "How can I be... when I'm so utterly pathetic..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I should've seen right through him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "None of this was your fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"You were just trying to trust him, Reimi. That's what you do when you're in "
"a relationship, right? So don't be too hard on yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Heh, well... I am starting to feel a little better... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Especially after seeing you beat "
"the snot outta him. Yeah, I think that was just what I needed. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "...You know what else I need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"You. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> I've had my heart set on you "
"for a long time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "So... Maybe we could spend a little private time together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Oh, uh... Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> You're so cute when you're "
"put on the spot! I love it! <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"You know, I still am the number one hostess in Kamurocho and Roppongi... So "
"consider yourself a lucky man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Oh, and by the way... I'm not taking no for an answer. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

